{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_E4AC4791","title":"Return to Gideon","entry":"Dlg_E4AC4791::entry","exit":"Dlg_E4AC4791::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_DBEF4D75","articyId":"72057774426569495","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"Well?","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17056","byteOffset":14342608,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_C14B3CA0","articyId":"72057774426569516","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"The kid is clever. She knows how to play everyone, including you. I... I wish I could see her more.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The kid is clever. She knows how to play everyone, including you. I... I wish I could see her more.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31309","byteOffset":19724784,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_D35C63F4","articyId":"72057774426569531","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"Most days I don't like my job... But I have to do it. It's all I know.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Most days I don't like my job... But I have to do it. It's all I know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52022","byteOffset":34096016,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_911E9877","articyId":"72057774426569552","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"I'm too old and stubborn to change. Ain't no way I'm stopping bounty hunting... till somebody stops me with a bullet.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm too old and stubborn to change. Ain't no way I'm stopping bounty hunting... till somebody stops me with a bullet.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27261","byteOffset":18192496,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_318065A3","articyId":"72057774426569565","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"All business huh? Fair enough. A promise is a promise.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"All business huh? Fair enough. A promise is a promise.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24449","byteOffset":17126904,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_00C8CD27","articyId":"72057774426569571","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"Look, if you want some kind of leverage on Razlo that will bring him down, I'll give it to you. But I ask that you do something first.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, if you want some kind of leverage on Razlo that will bring him down, I'll give it to you. But I ask that you do something first.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33928","byteOffset":20718224,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_72AC6C08","articyId":"72057774426569587","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"Are you sure about that? Do you know why you're chasing Razlo?","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you sure about that? Do you know why you're chasing Razlo?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33783","byteOffset":20663184,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_D8FE683C","articyId":"72057774426569652","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"I like to give straight answers, but that's not as simple a question as it seems.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I like to give straight answers, but that's not as simple a question as it seems.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29707","byteOffset":19119208,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_5686D70D","articyId":"72057821671316269","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"It will happen sooner or later - later if I'm smart, sooner if I start to slow down - lose my edge.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It will happen sooner or later - later if I'm smart, sooner if I start to slow down - lose my edge.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40594","byteOffset":29686048,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_B4AA5EE5","articyId":"72057774426569502","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I talked to Mila.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I talked to Mila.","TextSheVersion":"I talked to Mila.","TextTheyVersion":"I talked to Mila."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22752","byteOffset":16492296,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_55BB5785","articyId":"72057774426569508","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Mila told me you're her uncle.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Mila told me you're her uncle.","TextSheVersion":"Mila told me you're her uncle.","TextTheyVersion":"Mila told me you're her uncle."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39745","byteOffset":29366304,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_DF3EB3C6","articyId":"72057774426569524","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"She doesn't like your job.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She doesn't like your job.","TextSheVersion":"She doesn't like your job.","TextTheyVersion":"She doesn't like your job."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":900.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19674","byteOffset":15326656,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_6995D791","articyId":"72057774426569538","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"It's never too late to try something new.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's never too late to try something new.","TextSheVersion":"It's never too late to try something new.","TextTheyVersion":"It's never too late to try something new."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":-250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28917","byteOffset":18822880,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_E07F34F6","articyId":"72057774426569545","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Maybe you need to put family first.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe you need to put family first.","TextSheVersion":"Maybe you need to put family first.","TextTheyVersion":"Maybe you need to put family first."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21080","byteOffset":15856568,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_F2D41A8B","articyId":"72057774426569558","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You should be careful for her sake. Now will you help me?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You should be careful for her sake. Now will you help me?","TextSheVersion":"You should be careful for her sake. Now will you help me?","TextTheyVersion":"You should be careful for her sake. Now will you help me?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19863","byteOffset":15397392,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_710777F5","articyId":"72057774426569580","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I need you to help me take Razlo down.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need you to help me take Razlo down.","TextSheVersion":"I need you to help me take Razlo down.","TextTheyVersion":"I need you to help me take Razlo down."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26528","byteOffset":17915712,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_A4F537FD","articyId":"72057774426569594","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What?","TextSheVersion":"What?","TextTheyVersion":"What?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31178","byteOffset":19675768,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_3FFC474F","articyId":"72057774426569601","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Gideon","text":"Go talk to Razlo yourself.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Go talk to Razlo yourself.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4500.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43344","byteOffset":30726544,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_B794A5DE","articyId":"72057774426569608","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"This wasn't part of our deal.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This wasn't part of our deal.","TextSheVersion":"This wasn't part of our deal.","TextTheyVersion":"This wasn't part of our deal."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40151","byteOffset":29519560,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_795C6595","articyId":"72057774426569614","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Why would I do that?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why would I do that?","TextSheVersion":"Why would I do that?","TextTheyVersion":"Why would I do that?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29169","byteOffset":18916832,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_0BA473A5","articyId":"72057774426569622","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Gideon","text":"Because pawns can't look back at the row behind them. There's a bigger game being played here, and you can continue as a pawn, or look around to see the whole board.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Because pawns can't look back at the row behind them. There's a bigger game being played here, and you can continue as a pawn, or look around to see the whole board.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18786","byteOffset":14994240,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_FD2505B1","articyId":"72057774426569630","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Whatever. We had a deal.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whatever. We had a deal.","TextSheVersion":"Whatever. We had a deal.","TextTheyVersion":"Whatever. We had a deal."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39610","byteOffset":29314120,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_B8861166","articyId":"72057774426569638","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What do you know about Razlo?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do you know about Razlo?","TextSheVersion":"What do you know about Razlo?","TextTheyVersion":"What do you know about Razlo?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27144","byteOffset":18147832,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_198ED725","articyId":"72057774426569644","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Is Razlo really some sort of criminal mastermind?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Is Razlo really some sort of criminal mastermind?","TextSheVersion":"Is Razlo really some sort of criminal mastermind?","TextTheyVersion":"Is Razlo really some sort of criminal mastermind?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50969","byteOffset":33621680,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_B296D613","articyId":"72057774426569662","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What should I say to him?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What should I say to him?","TextSheVersion":"What should I say to him?","TextTheyVersion":"What should I say to him?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18449","byteOffset":14866640,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_964DEA3D","articyId":"72057774426569669","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Gideon","text":"Ask him about \"The Phaze Runner.\" As soon as you say that name, he'll tell you everything.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ask him about \"The Phaze Runner.\" As soon as you say that name, he'll tell you everything.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5700.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47912","byteOffset":32462104,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_B9FB4B32","articyId":"72057774426569676","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Alright, thanks.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright, thanks.","TextSheVersion":"Alright, thanks.","TextTheyVersion":"Alright, thanks."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6000.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41094","byteOffset":29875560,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_AAB4C641","articyId":"72057774426569710","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Bounty hunting is your career. She should understand that.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Bounty hunting is your career. She should understand that.","TextSheVersion":"Bounty hunting is your career. She should understand that.","TextTheyVersion":"Bounty hunting is your career. She should understand that."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19252","byteOffset":15167920,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_F15609AD","articyId":"72057774426569718","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Fine, but if I'm not happy with your answer, I'll be back.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Fine, but if I'm not happy with your answer, I'll be back.","TextSheVersion":"Fine, but if I'm not happy with your answer, I'll be back.","TextTheyVersion":"Fine, but if I'm not happy with your answer, I'll be back."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6000.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42757","byteOffset":30505232,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_68D23FFD","articyId":"72057606922845635","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"The Phaze Runner eh?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Phaze Runner eh?","TextSheVersion":"The Phaze Runner eh?","TextTheyVersion":"The Phaze Runner eh?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6000.0,"y":-250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49283","byteOffset":32986760,"by